Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.33,0:00:06.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The time is 2 p.m., and Mr. Uwe is in the drawing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:09.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The assassin's made their way into the manor\Ndisguised as a deliveryman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.25,0:00:12.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They have a weapon concealed in their pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.33,0:00:13.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:17.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I start by having Sara's animals\Ncheck them for firearms.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They aren't carrying anything that\Nsmells of gunpowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:22.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The assassin advances.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.29,0:00:27.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I station Lily and Sybilla on the\Nleft and right to stand guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:31.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The assassin turns the corner and\Nenters their blind spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:34.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They kill a nearby maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.75,0:00:36.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You lose your bead on their location.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.17,0:00:44.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That wasn't bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.58,0:00:45.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:46.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you up for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:48.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, I have a question...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:52.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The panties I'm wearing today are white.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.21,0:00:53.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That wasn't what I was going to ask.\N{\rSubtitle}The panties I'm wearing today are white.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:55.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really didn't have to finish that sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:56.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just as I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.92,0:01:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was actually hoping to ask about\Nsomething more serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.63,0:01:01.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Serious how?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.29,0:01:10.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why weren't you able to take advantage of\Nyour talents back at your academy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.08,0:01:14.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have everyone's test scores and evaluations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.38,0:01:17.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone else has logical reasons\Nfor why they washed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.92,0:01:21.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, you're the one person\NI don't have a good explanation for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.54,0:01:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.13,0:01:27.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I doubt you would believe me if I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.29,0:01:30.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I promise to accept whatever you tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.92,0:01:39.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The truth is,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.83,0:01:41.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not good with men.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.46,0:01:48.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:51.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I'm afraid I don't follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:57.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Being around men makes my stomach start hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:02:01.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You seem fine around me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:03.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're an exception, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:05.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, that seems awfully convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:07.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's fine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.67,0:02:09.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did promise to accept your explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.25,0:02:12.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That love of yours is a mysterious thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:13.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:16.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, I have a question for you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:20.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that cut on your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:24.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had an urgent mission this afternoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and embarrassingly, I got it caught on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.71,0:02:30.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your fatigue is starting to get you hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.58,0:02:32.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, you should go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:33.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.21,0:02:37.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, I have a backlog of reports\NI need to get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.67,0:02:44.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving this fountain pen back\Nuntil you get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.54,0:02:47.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:50.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Very well, I'll turn in for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.83,0:02:52.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can go ahead and-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:54.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'll get in bed with you\Nand sing you a lullaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.71,0:02:55.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.58,0:03:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You must be tired too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.58,0:03:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be asleep soon,\Nso please get the lights on your way-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.71,0:03:07.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.63,0:03:16.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you let your guard down because\Nit was me you were with?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:25.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Have you come to want to let me dote on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.17,0:03:27.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,even just a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:34.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm under no illusions about my love ever bearing fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:37.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But even so,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:41.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,once I complete the mission and make you proud,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:46.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,would it be greedy of me to hope for\Njust one percent of your affection?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.92,0:04:11.42,Song,,0,0,0,,SPY CLASSROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.75,0:04:15.88,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Itami ga unda daishou
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:23.17,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Nido to kienai kasabuta wo dakishime
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.17,0:04:28.54,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Gouin na sukimakaze ano hi sarawareta
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.54,0:04:33.21,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Kawarenai boku wa oiteikanakucha
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.50,0:04:38.42,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Nee fuan sae oikoshite
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.42,0:04:41.79,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Shiranakatta sora to kyou wa kono ashi de
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.79,0:04:44.63,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Chouyou wo mukaeyou
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:47.67,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Fukou ga kureta shiawase
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.67,0:04:50.42,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Zetsubou no hate ni mieta
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:55.71,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Shirube wa ima hitosuji no hi wo tomosu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.71,0:04:58.13,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Karamiau kako wo harae
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.13,0:05:06.04,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Kokoro ga hokorobu basho made aragau
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:11.92,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Ah, shunkan ikinobiro
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:20.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.83,0:05:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,there's going to be a dinner party at the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.29,0:05:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The attendees are just going to be politicians
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.29,0:05:27.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and other political bigwigs who share Mr. Uwe's views,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.29,0:05:29.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but we need to be prepared for anything\Nthat might happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:33.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sara, I need you to keep watch over\Nthe mansion starting tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:34.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:37.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, what can you tell me about\Nthe incident the other night?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.38,0:05:41.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sadly, there weren't any clues in the traps we set.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:45.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This little guy couldn't even pick up the bad guy's scent,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:47.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so they must have come prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.50,0:05:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.50,0:05:50.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.21,0:05:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,do you think there's a chance the assassin\Nwill come back tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:56.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a possibility,\Nwhich is why we're staying on high alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:58.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,R-right...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:02.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.21,0:06:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to give it my all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.79,0:06:06.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's reassuring to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.46,0:06:09.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have instructions from the boss:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.33,0:06:13.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Chisel Mr. Uwe like you were chiseling\Na rock from the bottom of the sea."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's that in normal-person talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.17,0:06:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I believe he wants you to get Uwe to tell you details
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.17,0:06:21.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,about the people who'll be\Nattending the function tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:22.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.92,0:06:27.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's good, Uwe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:29.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should start thinkin' about heading out, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.92,0:06:32.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's an hour earlier than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.21,0:06:34.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but the weather's not gonna hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.71,0:06:36.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, if we get there early,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:38.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you can tell me all about the people\Nwho'll be comin' tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:43.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go plant more bugs around\Nthe mansion to get ready for the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.04,0:06:48.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily, would you mind distracting the\Nother residents for me while I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.21,0:06:49.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.75,0:06:55.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I figured you'd ask, so I actually already knocked over\Na bucket and soaked the hallway downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.71,0:06:58.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think I might've developed a knack for precognition-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:02.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shoot! I didn't think she'd find it 'til later!\N{\rSubtitle-3}Who did this?! Who poured water everywhere?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.17,0:07:06.79,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Lily's bold moves make for a perfect diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.33,0:07:08.83,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Everything's going smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.42,0:07:51.13,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,No intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.50,0:07:54.25,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,I went through the pockets of\Neveryone who seemed sketchy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.25,0:07:55.83,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,but none of 'em had any weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.29,0:07:58.50,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Sara didn't see anything out of the ordinary, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:08:01.29,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,And Lily even got through her maid work\Nwithout screwing up for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.29,0:08:03.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Probably 'cuz your instructions were so dang good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:05.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:07.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If anything, I should be the one complimenting you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.50,0:08:09.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I spent the entire party hiding away in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.00,0:08:11.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, Grete,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.63,0:08:15.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you said you came from a politician's family, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.50,0:08:18.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did. What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you spend a bunch of time at\Nhigh society shindigs like this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:22.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm kinda jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:25.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's like, it's all so swanky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.04,0:08:27.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:30.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never could find a place for myself in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:34.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.08,0:08:37.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grete!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.33,0:08:39.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could I speak with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why'd you spend the whole party over in the kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted you out on the floor mingling with the guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:55.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My deepest apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.46,0:08:57.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wasn't feeling well,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:08:59.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I figured I could at least help by\Nwashing dishes and cleaning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.50,0:09:02.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The world of politics is dominated by men, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:04.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Having a couple of cute young maids going\Naround with smiles on their faces
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.88,0:09:07.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,helps make parties like ours run that much smoother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:09.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:10.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, what's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.42,0:09:12.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you just feel like slacking off?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.63,0:09:14.58,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,If I tell her that I have problems dealing with men,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:18.21,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,she'll see me as unfit to be a maid,\Nand she might even fire me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.67,0:09:21.71,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,That said, the more lies I pile on, the more likely\Nmy whole story is to eventually fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.71,0:09:22.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grete?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:26.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,T-to tell you the truth,\Nthere's someone I'm quite in love with,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:28.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so getting close to other men doesn't-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.08,0:09:30.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That changes everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.63,0:09:31.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Spill, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.17,0:09:33.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.29,0:09:36.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's what you would call lovesickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.96,0:09:40.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When I think of him, it makes me\Nnot want to talk to other men.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.88,0:09:43.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, was it that guy from the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.13,0:09:46.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I saw Sybilla and Lily talking to a total hunk\Nright after the assassin attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Skinny guy, long hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.71,0:09:51.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That man's just a teacher from our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:56.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I suspect he was just dropping by\Nhis students' job site to check in on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:59.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's not the guy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:01.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can I have him, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:02.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:04.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, a schoolteacher like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:06.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's probably all kinds of pent up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:09.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I'd have to do is get some drinks in him and pretend\Nto be tipsy so I could press my chest against him,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I could get him into bed and\Nlet nature take its course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.71,0:10:15.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.13,0:10:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can make faces like that after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:21.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm kidding, I'm kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, I've got nothing against lovesickness,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.42,0:10:25.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,just make sure it doesn't get in the way of your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:28.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, men flock to good-looking gals like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:30.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't have to take life so seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.71,0:10:34.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Needy women don't get loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.58,0:10:37.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I despise that philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.25,0:10:40.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't stand people who don't put in the work
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.88,0:10:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to be worthy of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:44.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:52.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right there the reason nobody loves you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:54.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I hit the nail on the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.75,0:11:00.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.17,0:11:02.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The room feels darker just having you in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.29,0:11:04.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you look like you're fighting back\Na grimace the whole time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you'll just bring down the mood\Nat the parties anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:09.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By your leave, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.79,0:11:17.13,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,That was made in Galgad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:20.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a very pretty brooch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.08,0:11:22.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was a present from my boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:23.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.67,0:11:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nothing, I was just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.29,0:11:38.58,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:41.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right there the reason nobody loves you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.83,0:11:44.04,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,I know that.\NHow could I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.08,0:11:52.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never got a chance to give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Boss...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:11:59.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.29,0:12:01.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Long day, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:03.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily? Did something-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.71,0:12:05.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nah, you just stay right where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.17,0:12:09.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pat, pat...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:10.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.54,0:12:14.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You looked super tired,\Nso I thought I'd pamper you a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.83,0:12:18.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry it's my hands and not Teach's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.71,0:12:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dang, you've got all kinds of knots.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:22.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It makes sense, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.67,0:12:25.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,considering the unreal amount of work you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.17,0:12:26.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're giving me too much credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:29.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And she's humble, to boot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.96,0:12:32.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have a very impressive figure, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:34.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where's this coming from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.83,0:12:37.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've tried to seduce the boss so many times,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:39.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but the constant failures are\Nstarting to make me nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.71,0:12:42.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nah, c'mon, don't beat yourself up about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.58,0:12:44.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, your figure is plenty...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.21,0:12:46.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.46,0:12:47.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Plenty what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.33,0:12:50.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Plenty good for crossdressing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-that's our resident master of disguise for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.50,0:12:57.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's such an expert, she doesn't even need\Na chest binder to pass as a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.46,0:13:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why, it's basically like she's\Ncrossdressing twenty-four-seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:04.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would it be all right if I broke your pinky finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.63,0:13:06.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're that pissed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.17,0:13:08.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.67,0:13:12.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There're loads of charming things about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.63,0:13:15.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why no matter what happens,\Nwe'll always be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.29,0:13:27.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I find it hard to imagine there being\Nanything charming about me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.33,0:13:30.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who would ever love a girl like you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:33.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why can't you even smile like a normal person?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:38.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why was I burdened with a daughter\Nas creepy as you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.63,0:13:51.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Androphobia, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.88,0:13:56.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Her father all but forced her to enroll in her academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.46,0:14:00.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The official story is that she's living overseas\Nas part of the treatment for some illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:05.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In other words, her politician father\Nbasically abandoned her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.63,0:14:10.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It says here she chose the code name\NDaughter Dearest herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:16.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure there are plenty of things these\Nscraps of paper can't possibly tell me about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.71,0:14:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, it's high time we started...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.92,0:14:26.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,this assassin hunt of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.96,0:14:39.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is a list of the politicians we suspect\Nwere killed by Corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.63,0:14:42.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Corpse's primary MO is making it look like\Nthe victims committed suicide
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.29,0:14:43.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,by jumping to their deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:46.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It doesn't use weapons, so it's hard to trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:48.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are probably all loads\Nof other assassinations
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:51.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that have been written off as suicides\Nthat we just don't know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.21,0:14:52.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's so messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:55.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Many of the dead politicians were people\Nwho devoted everything they had
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:58.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to getting our nation back on its feet after the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:14:59.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Losing them hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:01.83,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,So, this is why they call it a shadow war.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:03.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sara...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:05.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As the World's Strongest,\NI'll make sure I put Corpse down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.83,0:15:10.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be so afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.75,0:15:15.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I have to tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.79,0:15:18.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know it's pathetic,\Nbut hearing that made me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.42,0:15:21.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you've started relying on us,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.21,0:15:25.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but if I'm being totally honest, I feel a lot safer\Nwhen I know you're protecting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.63,0:15:28.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's nothing to be ashamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.08,0:15:32.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But, um, that's why I think you should\Npay more attention to Miss Grete.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.67,0:15:38.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you realize just how much courage\Nit takes her to do what she's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:41.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Duly noted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.21,0:15:50.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uwe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.42,0:15:51.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn you, killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.83,0:15:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doin', dumbass?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:58.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should know that\Ngivin' your opponent a clear shot
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:16:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is about the most dangerous thing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.33,0:16:01.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,R-right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.71,0:16:06.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.17,0:16:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And it's all thanks to you, White.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.54,0:16:13.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When you moved my bed away from the window,\Nit made it into a blind spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:15.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was able to escape his shots unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.58,0:16:18.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dang, that was a lucky-ass coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.67,0:16:20.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:22.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was that man with the hideous birthmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.13,0:16:23.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You actually got a good look at him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.46,0:16:26.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My eyes have gotten a lot better\Nsince you lot started cooking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:30.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The next time he shows it will be\Nthe day he meets his maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.13,0:16:33.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, you wanna think about hiring a security guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.33,0:16:35.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This guy's shown up twice in a single week.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.83,0:16:37.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No price is too high
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.42,0:16:39.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,when it comes to keepin' your family safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.96,0:16:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't do that if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.00,0:16:49.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Welcoming more outsiders into the house\Ncan't possibly be a good idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:16:52.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,not when you have no idea who the assassin might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.08,0:16:53.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm terrified at the very thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.75,0:16:55.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.42,0:16:59.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If anything, shouldn't you think about firing\Nthe intruders who only just got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.58,0:17:02.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:03.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who do you think it was that saved Uwe just-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, you don't seem frightened by any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.83,0:17:08.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Neither do the other two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.29,0:17:10.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You were so brave during the first attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.83,0:17:13.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you used to things like this?\NWhy is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.54,0:17:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Was you moving the bed really just a coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.88,0:17:21.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uwe, don't you think we should look into\Nthe girls' backgrounds again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.79,0:17:25.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For example, we could start with a thorough\Ninspection of their personal effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.92,0:17:27.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, Olivia...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.21,0:17:35.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it's dangerous to pick up glass with your bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.04,0:17:37.25,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,Glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.75,0:17:43.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're so right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:44.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I cut my finger a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.42,0:17:48.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to go wash up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.67,0:17:59.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When did Olivia grab that glass shard?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.29,0:18:02.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If she had wanted to, she could've-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.08,0:18:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sybilla, please focus on your maid work for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.67,0:18:09.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Say, what's that punk Klaus got to say about all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:13.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He says to leave everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.21,0:18:16.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He really trusts you that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.58,0:18:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Also, where is he even?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.71,0:18:28.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sybilla, I'll handle the cleanup in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.33,0:18:30.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you mind taking Uwe to another room?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.75,0:18:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.25,0:18:43.67,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,I have the situation under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.29,0:18:46.46,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,The enemy is starting to show their true colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:49.88,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,I need to start making preparations for the showdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.38,0:18:52.67,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,From here on out,\NI can't afford to make a single mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.88,0:18:54.38,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,If I screw up...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.63,0:19:02.75,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,I'll revise the plan as many times as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.50,0:19:05.88,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,I just need a little more time...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:12.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Grete?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.42,0:19:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.79,0:19:18.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My foot slipped a little, but I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.04,0:19:19.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.04,0:19:21.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You need another massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.88,0:19:25.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna knead you up until your whole\Nbody's as mushy as a jellyfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.67,0:19:28.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-you really don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.58,0:19:31.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-may I ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.04,0:19:33.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tricked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.54,0:19:37.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Secure the target!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.96,0:19:41.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what exactly are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.00,0:19:43.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Enemies are to be brutally interrogated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:44.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what do you plan on doing with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.96,0:19:47.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here, we show our enemies no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.42,0:19:50.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-but yesterday, you said we would always be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.63,0:19:51.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was fibbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.63,0:19:54.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you think there are some lies\Nyou really shouldn't tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.88,0:19:58.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you thought we were gonna be the ones\Ngetting conned forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.79,0:20:00.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then you were dead wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.33,0:20:03.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A listening device?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:04.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.79,0:20:06.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, the guy with the birthmark...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.08,0:20:10.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was secretly you in disguise, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:17.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.00,0:20:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're right, it was me all alon-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.75,0:20:23.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.46,0:20:25.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, why'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.50,0:20:28.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I was about to tell you, but then you distracted me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:31.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your reactions are so cute, I couldn't help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.79,0:20:41.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I disguised myself as the assassin\Nso could watch how any maids and guards reacted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.13,0:20:45.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That way, I could see if any of them\Nhad undergone special training.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.88,0:20:48.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's time you looped us in?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.71,0:20:50.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's this mission really about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.96,0:20:52.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're incredible, Grete.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.96,0:21:00.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In the end, none of the rest of us were able to tell\Nthe boss that we wanted to share his burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.13,0:21:02.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But now, I'll say this:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.96,0:21:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to share your burden, Grete.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.17,0:21:10.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ditto to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.42,0:21:11.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:15.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:19.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please listen, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.33,0:21:20.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our target, Corpse, is actually-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.83,0:21:24.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I figured you kids were operatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.83,0:21:28.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, fine, we can ditch the subtlety this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.04,0:21:31.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get to the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:41.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Round two!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.38,0:21:46.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bernard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.25,0:21:52.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,MR. BERNARD!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.00,0:21:57.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where's Teach?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.50,0:21:59.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to get him here, fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.46,0:22:00.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.50,0:22:04.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The boss won't be coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.33,0:22:09.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is a battle we have to win on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.33,0:22:14.79,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Furishikiru yoru o zutto nagameteta
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.79,0:22:17.46,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Doredake chikazuitemo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.46,0:22:19.71,Song-2,,0,0,0,,(Give it up, give it up)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.04,0:22:23.67,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Himitsu no namae sotto watasetara
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.67,0:22:29.33,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Mitsukaranai you ni kurayami ni toketeiku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.92,0:22:40.58,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Kossori naiteta koto mo wasurechatta
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.58,0:22:44.08,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Saibou ga irekawatta mitai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.08,0:22:46.46,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Betsu no hito ni nattari
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.79,0:22:50.17,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Isogashii hibi motto fuzakeyou ne
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.17,0:22:52.96,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Chotto kimi to hanashitai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.96,0:22:55.21,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Daremo mou inai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.21,0:22:58.96,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Yakusokuda nante
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.96,0:23:02.42,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Sonna mono janai deshou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.46,0:23:08.00,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Furishikiru yoru o zutto nagameteta
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.00,0:23:10.83,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Doredake chikazuitemo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.83,0:23:13.08,Song-2,,0,0,0,,(Give it up, give it up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.38,0:23:17.04,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Himitsu no namae sotto watasetara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.04,0:23:22.21,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Mitsukaranai you ni kurayami ni toketeiku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.21,0:23:23.67,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Soshite umarekawatte
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.67,0:23:26.00,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Massara na yozora wo tobimawatte
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:30.58,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Nando mo kousa kimi to watashi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.75,0:23:32.25,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Suihei na hoshi ni tatte
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.25,0:23:34.79,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Masugu na hitomi de mitsumeatte
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.79,0:23:39.50,Song-2,,0,0,0,,Mata aeta toki ni watashitai yo
